      "difficulty": "Easy",
      "prompt": "Disk method for $y=\\sqrt{x}$ on $[0,4]$ about x-axis gives:\nA) $4\\pi$\nB) $8\\pi$\nC) $16\\pi$\nD) $2\\pi$",
